    <library>
      <description>SK hynix 64 GB eMMC 5.1 and 32 Gbit LPDDR4X. Ball assignments from hardware/compute_board/emcp_ballmap_source.csv, datasheet p. 6. The optional NC gate contains all no-connect, do-not-use and vendor-specific balls.</description>
      <packages>
        <package name="FBGA254_11.5X13.0_P0.50">
          <description>SK hynix H9HP52ACPMADAR Rev 1.0 p. 9: 254-ball FBGA, 11.5 x 13.0 mm body, 0.50 mm pitch, ball diameter 0.300 +/- 0.050 mm before reflow. The round SMD copper pads use the 0.300 mm nominal ball diameter from that drawing. Page 9 specifies package dimensions rather than a separate PCB land pattern. The top-view A1 orientation follows the ball map on p. 6. The layer 39 courtyard extends 0.25 mm beyond the nominal body.</description>
